<title>UK: Bradford wool market sees pre-holiday interest.</title>
<headline>Bradford wool market sees pre-holiday interest.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Buying interest picked-up slightly and a better call for deliveries was noted this week in the Bradford wool market.</p>
<p>But dealers said this was probably just a last minute rush which often occurs ahead of summer holiday breaks in Europe, particularly in Italy.</p>
<p>But otherwise the market was very quiet with sterling's strength still a problem for exporters.</p>
<p>Lonodn Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
